winpe-terminal (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release.
  * QEMU/KVM Windows PE start with EMS/SAC terminal pass-through.
  * Explicit partition whitelist, identity checks and synthetic NBD disk.
  * prepare builds the local WinPE image from official Microsoft payloads.
  * Instance records, status, graceful shutdown and apt-integrated uninstall.

 -- winpe_terminal contributors <noreply@example.invalid>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0800
